---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms and Conditions | Paw & Co.">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="bg-slate-50">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-600">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">These terms apply to purchases and use of the Paw &amp; Co. website. They are drafted to support e-commerce operations in Portugal and the EU, including consumer rights for distance sales.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 2026-07-30</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">1. Seller Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Paw &amp; Co. should publish its official legal name, tax/VAT number, registered address, and support contacts before public launch. This information must be accurate and easily accessible to consumers.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Scope and Acceptance</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">By using this website or placing an order, the customer agrees to these terms. If the customer does not agree, they should not complete a purchase.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Products, Pricing, and Availability</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Product descriptions and prices are displayed on each product page. Prices must be shown in EUR with VAT information where required. Availability may change, and confirmed orders depend on stock verification and successful payment authorization.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Payment Methods</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Payments are processed through secure third-party providers (such as Stripe). During test mode, no real charge is captured. In production mode, charges are processed only after customer authorization.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Delivery and Order Execution</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Estimated delivery times, delivery zones, and costs should be clearly stated at checkout. If a delay occurs, the customer should be informed through the provided contact channel.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Right of Withdrawal (Portugal/EU Distance Sales)</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Consumers generally have 14 calendar days to withdraw from a distance contract without giving a reason, except in legally excluded cases. The withdrawal process, return address, and refund timing should be documented in the returns policy.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">7. Returns and Refunds</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Returned items must follow the stated return conditions. Refunds should be issued using the original payment method unless otherwise agreed, and within the legally required timelines.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">8. Warranty and Non-Conforming Goods</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Consumer legal guarantee rights under Portuguese and EU law remain unaffected by these terms. Customers may request repair, replacement, price reduction, or contract termination in accordance with applicable law.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">9. Complaints and Alternative Dispute Resolution</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Customers may submit complaints through support channels and, where applicable, through the Portuguese Livro de Reclamações and recognized ADR entities. Official references should be included with live business details before launch.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">10. Privacy and Data Protection</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">Personal data processing is governed by the privacy policy and applicable GDPR requirements. Customers should be informed about purpose, legal basis, retention, and rights of access, correction, and deletion.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">11. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">These terms are governed by Portuguese law, without prejudice to mandatory consumer protections under EU law. Competent courts and dispute channels should be indicated with final company details.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-8 text-amber-900 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Important note before publishing</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-8">This page is a compliance-oriented template and not legal advice. Replace placeholders with your official business details and have the final terms reviewed by legal counsel in Portugal before going live.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
